{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable"},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Keys-and-storage","text":"Keys and storage"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode before each presentation. Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Info.plist."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":": complete data protection, out of backups."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per key store and credential store, and share it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" as false and can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"development only."}]},{"anchor":"Trust","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Trust"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for credentials, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register themselves."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For readers, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" where every reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must be a known one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never ship with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"text":" set.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins"},{"text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requests, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPinnedDomains"},{"text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" yourself."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Privacy","level":3,"text":"Privacy"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request batches of copies ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize"},{"text":") and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh them as they’re used up ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so presentations stay unlinkable; warn the holder when one wouldn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Log ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message"},{"text":", never claims or credentials.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"The-build","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ship the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", which the package links by default."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Refuse to run on the test build, which carries an in-process issuer and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier: check "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch."}]},{"anchor":"A-document-provider-extension","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"A document provider extension"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app and its extension each update a credential’s record — marking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a copy presented, replacing copies on refresh — with a lock that spans"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only their own process. Refresh credentials when the app becomes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"active, not while it’s in the background, so the two don’t write the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same record at once."}]}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"Going to production","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier ("},{"code":"-tags mobiletest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"): an app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should refuse to run on it."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isTestBuild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"title":"isTestBuild","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore/isDurable":{"kind":"symbol","title":"isDurable","required":true,"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether keys survive the app quitting. Receiving credentials needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a durable store unless the configuration is for development; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default is false."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isDurable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore\/isdurable","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","defaultImplementations":1,"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/holderKeyPresent":{"kind":"symbol","title":"holderKeyPresent","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the key store still holds the credential’s key: without it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(restored to another device, say) it can’t be presented. Set in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.credentials()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.credential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderKeyPresent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/holderkeypresent","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/batchSize":{"kind":"symbol","title":"batchSize","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many copies of each credential to request when an issuer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers batches, each bound to its own key, so each presentation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can use one no Verifier has seen. 0 means the SDK’s default (5);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s capped at the issuer’s batch size."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/batchsize","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/development":{"kind":"symbol","title":"development","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Relaxes what production requires, for a wallet talking to services"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on a development machine. Never ship an app with it set. It lets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuers, Authorization Servers, Verifiers and status lists be on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loopback addresses, over http there too, and skips the production"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checks on receiving credentials: durable stores and keys, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"random source."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"development","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/development","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"kind":"symbol","title":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PEM certificates: the mdoc readers recognized when one signs an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" request ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MdocPresentation.Request.reader"},{"type":"text","text":"). Empty:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every such request is shown by its origin."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocReaderRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderroots","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/issuerRoots":{"kind":"symbol","title":"issuerRoots","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PEM certificates: the trust anchors for issuers’ credentials, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for Verifiers’ requests."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"issuerRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/issuerroots","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/message":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/message","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Detail for logs: at most 300 characters, with no personal data, no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remote party’s own description, and no URL’s path or query."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"message","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"title":"message","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"kind":"article","title":"Handling errors","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helps without personal data.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/tlsPins":{"kind":"symbol","title":"tlsPins","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Pins hosts’ certificates for the wallet’s own HTTPS requests:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a certificate’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SubjectPublicKeyInfo, one of which a certificate in the verified","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chain must have, or the request fails as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tlsPin"},{"text":" before anything","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is sent. A host is a name, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*."},{"text":" and one, matching any name a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"label below it; not an IP address. Pins add to certificate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verification, never replace it: pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin. They cover the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requests the SDK makes (issuers, Authorization Servers,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifiers, status lists), not the app’s own, such as to its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider: pin that client yourself.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tlsPins"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" : ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletcon